WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.730
Hey kids!

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.140
Have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.990
The Zambezi River runs to the edge — and drops!

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.460
Whoosh! Look at all that spray!

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.860
And rainbows in the mist.
